        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rosetta： 已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam, удаление программ, запуск с параметрами:\n  onwinctl steam-games <пространство>      игры Steam в пространстве (appmanifest_*.acf)\n  onwinctl steam-launch <пространство> <appid|название> [аргументы...]  steam.exe -applaunch <appid>\n  onwinctl steam-install <пространство> <appid> открыть steam://install/<appid> в Steam пространства\n  onwinctl vdf <файл.vdf|.acf> [ключ/ключ...]   разобрать файл Valve KeyValues (проверка)\n  onwinctl uninstall-list <пространство>   программы из реестра (…\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall)\n  onwinctl uninstall <пространство> <название|ключ> [--quiet] [--dry-run]\n                                           запустить удаление; --quiet — тихо (QuietUninstallString, msiexec /qn)\n  onwinctl run-command <пространство> [--backend b] [--hud on|off] [--no-avx] [--avx] [--winedebug каналы]\n                       [--env ИМЯ=ЗНАЧЕНИЕ]... [--dry-run] <командная строка Windows>\n                                           выполнить команду с параметрами одного запуска и ждать\n  onwinctl reboot <пространство>           «перезагрузить Windows» (wineboot --restart)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam, uninstalling programs, running with options:\n  onwinctl steam-games <space>             Steam games in the space (appmanifest_*.acf)\n  onwinctl steam-launch <space> <appid|name> [arguments...]  steam.exe -applaunch <appid>\n  onwinctl steam-install <space> <appid>   open steam://install/<appid> in the space’s Steam\n  onwinctl vdf <file.vdf|.acf> [key/key...]  parse a Valve KeyValues file (testing)\n  onwinctl uninstall-list <space>          programs from the registry (…\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall)\n  onwinctl uninstall <space> <name|key> [--quiet] [--dry-run]\n                                           run the uninstaller; --quiet: silently (QuietUninstallString, msiexec /qn)\n  onwinctl run-command <space> [--backend b] [--hud on|off] [--no-avx] [--avx] [--winedebug channels]\n                       [--env NAME=VALUE]... [--dry-run] <Windows command line>\n                                           run a command with one-time launch options and wait\n  onwinctl reboot <space>                  “restart Windows” (wineboot --restart)"
          }
        },
        "kk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam, бағдарламаларды жою, параметрлермен іске қосу:\n  onwinctl steam-games <кеңістік>          кеңістіктегі Steam ойындары (appmanifest_*.acf)\n  onwinctl steam-launch <кеңістік> <appid|атауы> [аргументтер...]       steam.exe -applaunch <appid>\n  onwinctl steam-install <кеңістік> <appid> кеңістіктегі Steam ішінде steam://install/<appid> ашу\n  onwinctl vdf <файл.vdf|.acf> [кілт/кілт...]   Valve KeyValues файлын талдау (тексеру)\n  onwinctl uninstall-list <кеңістік>       тізілімдегі бағдарламалар (…\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall)\n  onwinctl uninstall <кеңістік> <атауы|кілт> [--quiet] [--dry-run]\n                                           жоюды іске қосу; --quiet — үнсіз (QuietUninstallString, msiexec /qn)\n  onwinctl run-command <кеңістік> [--backend b] [--hud on|off] [--no-avx] [--avx] [--winedebug арналар]\n                       [--env АТЫ=МӘНІ]... [--dry-run] <Windows пәрмен жолы>\n                                           бір іске қосуға арналған параметрлермен пәрменді орындап, күту\n  onwinctl reboot <кеңістік>               «Windows жүйесін қайта іске қосу» (wineboot --restart)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam、卸载程序、带参数运行：\n  onwinctl steam-games <空间>              空间中的 Steam 游戏（appmanifest_*.acf）\n  onwinctl steam-launch <空间> <appid|名称> [参数...]  steam.exe -applaunch <appid>\n  onwinctl steam-install <空间> <appid>    在空间的 Steam 中打开 steam://install/<appid>\n  onwinctl vdf <文件.vdf|.acf> [键/键...]  解析 Valve KeyValues 文件（检查用）\n  onwinctl uninstall-list <空间>           注册表中的程序（…\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall）\n  onwinctl uninstall <空间> <名称|键> [--quiet] [--dry-run]\n                                           运行卸载；--quiet — 静默卸载（QuietUninstallString，msiexec /qn）\n  onwinctl run-command <空间> [--backend b] [--hud on|off] [--no-avx] [--avx] [--winedebug 通道]\n                       [--env 名称=值]... [--dry-run] <Windows 命令行>\n                                           使用单次运行的参数执行命令并等待\n  onwinctl reboot <空间>                   “重启 Windows”（wineboot --restart）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
